Route23_Text_MayIntro::
	.string "MAY: {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "You actually made it through!\p"
	.string "Since we met at MT. MOON, I've been\n"
	.string "watching your progress.\p"
	.string "You've grown incredibly strong, but\n"
	.string "the POKéMON LEAGUE is a whole\l"
	.string "different level of challenge.\p"
	.string "As a researcher from HOENN, I've\n"
	.string "assembled a team that represents\l"
	.string "the absolute best of my region.\p"
	.string "Before you face the ELITE FOUR...\n"
	.string "Show me everything you've learned!$"

Route23_Text_MayDefeat::
	.string "Amazing!\n"
	.string "Your bond with your POKéMON...\l"
	.string "It's completely unbreakable!$"

Route23_Text_MayPostBattle::
	.string "MAY: I have nothing left to teach you,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "With that kind of strength, I know\n"
	.string "you're ready to face the CHAMPION.\p"
	.string "I hear he's also from HOENN.\n"
	.string "Give him a battle he'll never forget!\p"
	.string "Good luck, {PLAYER}!$"

